GOAL

Don't sell Rallynex.

Start conversations with founders.

Understand their workflow.

Discover one pain.

Show one solution.

Invite them to help build the product.

--------------------------------------------------

1. FIND

Find founders actively building in public.

✓ Reddit
✓ Indie Hackers
✓ X

--------------------------------------------------

2. RESEARCH (30–60 seconds)

Read their recent posts.

Know what they're building.

Never send blind DMs.

--------------------------------------------------

3. START

Don't pitch.

Ask permission.

"Can I ask you something about your build-in-public workflow?"

--------------------------------------------------

4. DISCOVER

Ask one workflow question.

"How do you keep track of everything you build before posting?"

Keep asking WHY until you discover friction.

Examples:

• I forget.
• My notes are messy.
• Writing posts takes forever.
• I don't stay consistent.

Your mission:

Understand their workflow better than anyone else.

--------------------------------------------------

5. CONFIRM

Repeat their pain back.

"So the real problem is..."

Wait until they say

"Exactly."

Only then continue.

--------------------------------------------------

6. DEMO

Never demo Rallynex.

Demo THEIR solution.

Create a 30–90 second personalized video.

Show ONLY the feature that removes THEIR pain.

Not every feature.

Not your roadmap.

One problem.

One solution.

--------------------------------------------------

7. INVITE

"I'm building Rallynex around this exact problem.

Would you be open to trying it and giving me honest feedback?"

You're inviting them into the journey.

Not pushing a sale.

--------------------------------------------------

8. FOLLOW UP

After a few days:

• What worked?
• What felt awkward?
• What's missing?
• Would this fit your workflow?

Listen more than you talk.

--------------------------------------------------

RULES

❌ Don't explain every feature.

❌ Don't send generic demos.

❌ Don't argue with objections.

❌ Don't chase everyone.

✅ Ask.

✅ Listen.

✅ Understand.

✅ Personalize.

✅ Solve one pain.

--------------------------------------------------

REMEMBER

People don't buy Rallynex.

They buy relief.

Every conversation should make the founder think:

"This person understands exactly how I work."

Once they feel understood,

Rallynex becomes the obvious next step.
